    "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nIn extension types, as a special attribute, \\_\\_dict__ shouldn't be declared as `public` or `readonly` (similar to \\_\\_weakref__). Currently Cython compiler does not check this restriction, and code such as\r\n\r\n```\r\ncdef class C:\r\n    cdef public dict __dict__\r\n```\r\n\r\ngenerates code failed to compile due to redefinition errors.\r\n\r\nThis commit adds a compiler error for this case, so users can identify the mistake quickly with a clearer diagnostic.\r\n",
    "closed_at": null,
